{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RHLW-2026-29290bdc0b7d8664","published":"2026-11-13T13:12:51Z","modified":"2026-11-13T18:45:02.446773005Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-59739","CVE-2026-59969","CVE-2026-79993","CVE-2026-84439","CVE-2026-84501"],"summary":"Lightwell Security Advisory: zookeeper 3.9.5.rhlw-00008","details":"Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper 3.9.5.rhlw-00008 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-59739, CVE-2026-59969, CVE-2026-79993, CVE-2026-84439, and CVE-2026-84501.\n\nCVE-2026-59739: Apache ZooKeeper: Information disclosure via SetWatches reconnect replay\n\nCVE-2026-59969: Apache ZooKeeper: Improper validation of certificate with host mismatch in FIPS mode\n\nCVE-2026-79993: Apache ZooKeeper: Missing ACL check on deleteContainer opcode allows unauthorized deletion of any empty persistent/container znode\n\nCVE-2026-84439: Apache ZooKeeper: Audit log injection via unsanitized output from multiple sources\n\nCVE-2026-84501: Apache ZooKeeper: Operational log forgery via newline injection in EnsembleAuthenticationProvider\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper 3.9.5 from Maven Central.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper","ecosystem":"Red Hat Lightwell:Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.zookeeper/zookeeper"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.9.5.rhlw-00008"}]}],"versions":["3.3.0","3.3.1","3.3.2","3.3.3","3.3.4","3.3.5","3.3.6","3.4.0","3.4.1","3.4.10","3.4.11","3.4.12","3.4.13","3.4.14","3.4.2","3.4.3","3.4.4","3.4.5","3.4.6","3.4.7","3.4.8","3.4.9","3.5.0-alpha","3.5.1-alpha","3.5.10","3.5.2-alpha","3.5.3-beta","3.5.4-beta","3.5.5","3.5.6","3.5.7","3.5.8","3.5.9","3.6.0","3.6.1","3.6.2","3.6.3","3.6.4","3.7.0","3.7.1","3.7.2","3.8.0","3.8.1","3.8.2","3.8.3","3.8.4","3.8.5","3.8.6","3.8.7","3.8.8","3.9.0","3.9.1","3.9.2","3.9.3","3.9.4","3.9.5"],"database_specific":{"lightwell":{"backport_base_version":"3.9.5","remediated_v